      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "在恒温、有催化剂条件下,反应器内进行如下反应"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{N_2(g)} + 3\\mathrm{H_2(g)} \\rightleftharpoons 2\\mathrm{NH_3(g)}$"
    },
